<pre><code><span class="c"># 1. Check where you are now</span>
pwd
<span class="c"># 2. Move to the Downloads folder</span>
cd Downloads
<span class="c"># 3. Create a new folder</span>
mkdir kist-test
<span class="c"># 4. Move into the folder you created</span>
cd kist-test
<span class="c"># 5. Run Claude Code in that folder</span>
claude</code></pre>
<p>Once you run <code>claude</code> in the folder you just created, Claude Code now does <strong>all its work inside that folder</strong>.</p>

<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">Today's gateway</span>
    "Create a folder &rarr; move there &rarr; run <code>claude</code>" &mdash; get this far and you can rely on the AI from then on. If you get stuck, don't hesitate to ask for help.
</div>
